{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "kind": "environment",
  "id": "example-12-dashboard-exit",
  "promptExampleId": "example-12",
  "prompt": "An 18-second virtual-camera shot from inside the braking car. Start behind the dashboard at world position (-0.15, 1.23, 30.25), facing world -Z with a 70-degree vertical field of view. Follow the dashboard so the camera rides with the car. When the car first slows below 5 metres per second, continue riding with the car while travelling 5 metres forward relative to it through the windshield over 2.5 seconds, with a soft launch and landing; treat the mounted cabin as intentional interior occupancy, and permit body crossing only during this explicitly virtual exit. Then make one complete rightward 360-degree arc around the car, ending on its front. No cut.",
